stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle

    Idle : Waiting for input
    Idle --> Processing : Submit request

    state Processing {
        [*] --> Validating
        Validating --> Parsing : Input valid
        Validating --> [*] : Input invalid
        Parsing --> Executing
        Executing --> [*]
    }

    Processing --> Success : Completed
    Processing --> Error : Failed

    state Error {
        [*] --> Analyzing
        Analyzing --> Retryable : Can retry
        Analyzing --> Fatal : Cannot recover
        Retryable --> [*]
        Fatal --> [*]
    }

    Error --> Idle : Retry
    Error --> [*] : Abort

    Success --> Idle : Reset
    Success --> [*] : Done

    Success : Operation completed
    Error : Something went wrong

    note right of Idle : System waits here\nuntil user acts
    note left of Processing : All validation and\nexecution happens here
    note right of Error : Errors are classified\nas retryable or fatal
